  exerciseTitle: Cannot pick up items
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458697
  exerciseText: Cannot pick up items
  hintText: Is the collision hitting the correct game object? Is it correctly set
    up?
  solutionText: Item has collider on the child object and not on the parent. The
    collider and the ItemHolder component need to be on the same game object.
